          "expr": "sum by (source, discovery_kind) (increase(news_articles_committed_total{job=\"backend\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} / {{discovery_kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "New article commits by source (1h)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Counter increase since this metric was installed; no historical backfill. Includes articles committed before a later feed failure. Pending-enrichment replays are separate. Counts are scrape-based estimates and can lose unsampled work on process restart."
    },
