      "title": "Article receipt to commit by source (15m)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "From the app's feed-response receipt to database commit, not publication time or UI delivery. Pending-enrichment timestamps start at the retry response and exclude historical queue age. Quantiles are bucket estimates; compare with commit counts and do not rank sparse samples."
    },
