      "title": "Source-page HTTP outcomes (15m)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Actual page HTTP requests, including unmapped items. Cache hits excluded. A 403 means the page request was refused; it does not establish a feed outage. error means no HTTP status. New status series and process restarts can omit the first unsampled request from increase()."
